{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>除夕想睇騷倒數又唔想煩交通？領華旅遊社推出江門2天團，主打12月31日晚《2027跨年演唱會》，現場睇MC張天賦、洪嘉豪同陳蕾，團費港幣899起，已經包括人民幣388的看台門票！\n</p>\n<p>2日1夜行程包4餐兼1晚酒店住宿。除了睇演唱會，還會去賞冬日限定紫花風鈴木花海，以及到果園任摘任食士多啤梨；餐飲則有牛肉火鍋及明爐脆皮燒鵝，全程專車接送。</p>\n<p>📅出發日期：2026年12月31日（僅辦1天）<br/>\n🩵留言「倒數」send旅行團報名連結給你～</p>\n<p>北上Check List ｜ 跟住呢個吃喝玩樂全指南，輕鬆北上玩轉大灣區同中國各大小城市！DM我哋分享你嘅獨特玩法！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552881663141990_13918771076b05987150979.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179552881663141990_13918771076b05987150979.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：Youtube@MC張天賦)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgH55BEEx0u/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%a3%e5%8d%80%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大灣區旅遊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b7%a8%e5%b9%b4%e5%a5%bd%e5%8e%bb%e8%99%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跨年好去處</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%a4%e5%a4%95%e5%80%92%e6%95%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">除夕倒數</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：Youtube@MC張天賦資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgH55BEEx0u/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:24:00.511018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:53.621775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:31.907721+00:00","content_hash":"32b6e47da84b9af5b4f9299566245f24e512f0d379a082e973699186fcdf7da6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}